                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Wow!  Boy is this H.O.G. short!\n\nLike literally...  You start the story, meet Gabriel Belmont...  I mean, Vincent the Bad Guy and then it's pretty much over!\n\nI think I was stuck on the Ship more than any other area lol.\n\nEverything is freaking fast too!\n\nMini-Games range from super easy to annoying af and it's just strangely all over the place.\n\nStory is...  Very minimal.  Which is normal for a H.O.G.\n\nI kinda like this.  It's weird, but I actually enjoyed it lol.\n\n(P.S.  Seriously, wth was that dude from Castlevania Lord of Shadows doing there?  Is that his brother?  Another mystery I suppose.)",
